      {
         "id": "SECTION_rules",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Rules</h3>The goal of the game is to pair each number with the name of its order. In each round, six orders are drawn at random from the ten possible orders, from units to billions. On the left, six numbers appear, each one belonging to a different order. On the right, the names of these same six orders appear in a different order. Select a number and then select the name of its order; if the pair is correct, both buttons are highlighted and stay in place. When you match all six pairs, a congratulations message is displayed. You can start a new round at any time by clicking the button <b>New Game</b>.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_game",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Sequence game (Orders)</h3>Connect each number on the left with the name of its order on the right. Select a number, then select its name to form the pair.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><div id=\"orderGame\" class=\"orderGame\"><div class=\"orderGameCol\" id=\"orderLeftCol\"></div><div class=\"orderGameCol\" id=\"orderRightCol\"></div></div></p><p id=\"orderFeedback\" class=\"orderFeedback\" style=\"display: none;\"></p><p id=\"orderCongrats\" class=\"orderCongrats\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\" style=\"color: gold;\"></i> PERFECT! You matched all the numbers with their order names!</p><p><button type=\"button\" id=\"orderResetBtn\" class=\"reset-tutor-btn\">🎲 New Game</button></p><div id=\"orderNames\" style=\"display: none;\"><span id=\"htOrderName0\">Units</span><span id=\"htOrderName1\">Tens</span><span id=\"htOrderName2\">Hundreds</span><span id=\"htOrderName3\">Thousands</span><span id=\"htOrderName4\">Ten Thousands</span><span id=\"htOrderName5\">Hundred Thousands</span><span id=\"htOrderName6\">Millions</span><span id=\"htOrderName7\">Ten Millions</span><span id=\"htOrderName8\">Hundred Millions</span><span id=\"htOrderName9\">Billions</span></div><div id=\"orderNumberDescs\" style=\"display: none;\"><span id=\"htOrderNumberDesc0\">is in the Units order, values between 0 and 9</span><span id=\"htOrderNumberDesc1\">is in the Tens order, values between 10 and 99</span><span id=\"htOrderNumberDesc2\">is in the Hundreds order, values between 100 and 999</span><span id=\"htOrderNumberDesc3\">is in the Thousands order, values between 1,000 and 9,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNumberDesc4\">is in the Ten Thousands order, values between 10,000 and 99,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNumberDesc5\">is in the Hundred Thousands order, values between 100,000 and 999,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNumberDesc6\">is in the Millions order, values between 1,000,000 and 9,999,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNumberDesc7\">is in the Ten Millions order, values between 10,000,000 and 99,999,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNumberDesc8\">is in the Hundred Millions order, values between 100,000,000 and 999,999,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNumberDesc9\">is in the Billions order, values between 1,000,000,000 and 9,999,999,999</span></div><div id=\"htOrderNameDescs\" style=\"display: none;\"><span id=\"htOrderNameDesc0\">Units are numbers in the range 0 and 9</span><span id=\"htOrderNameDesc1\">Tens are numbers in the range 10 and 99</span><span id=\"htOrderNameDesc2\">Hundreds are numbers in the range 100 and 999</span><span id=\"htOrderNameDesc3\">Thousands are numbers in the range 1,000 and 9,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNameDesc4\">Ten Thousands are numbers in the range 10,000 and 99,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNameDesc5\">Hundred Thousands are numbers in the range 100,000 and 999,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNameDesc6\">Millions are numbers in the range 1,000,000 and 9,999,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNameDesc7\">Ten Millions are numbers in the range 10,000,000 and 99,999,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNameDesc8\">Hundred Millions are numbers in the range 100,000,000 and 999,999,999</span><span id=\"htOrderNameDesc9\">Billions are numbers in the range 1,000,000,000 and 9,999,999,999</span></div>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\">The relationship between numbers and their orders is studied in <i>Sequence game (Part II)</i> (<htcite0>) and in <i>Numerical families (Part II)</i> (<htcite1>).</p>",
